The '''Bedroom''' is a special room located behind a double plank door, requiring two bombs to open. It usually contains a bed in a corner and a carpet in the center. Isaac can sleep in the bed once to recover all {{E|Red Heart}}s. If Isaac has no [[Red Heart container]]s, the bed will add three {{e|Soul Heart}}s instead.

Bedrooms have two variants: {{R|Clean Bedroom}}s and {{R|Dirty Bedroom}}s, with each version having a different map icon and color scheme. Which type of Bedroom is not revealed on the map until the room is entered.

Bedrooms can appear from [[Chapters|Chapter]] 1 to 3. They are more likely to generate if Isaac has low health.

== [[file:Bedroom Icon.png|25px|link=]] Clean Bedroom ==
[[file:Bed.png]]

=== Notes ===
* The trapdoor under the carpet will always lead to a {{R|Crawl Space}}.
* {{dlc|na}} In addition to healing Isaac, sleeping in the bed will also give one additional charge to his currently held [[activated item]].	
** The sleep sequence must be activated to get the charge. If the player wishes to recharge their item while Isaac is at full health, they have to intentionally take at least half a Red Heart damage before doing so.

