== Trivia ==
* The bedroom looks similar to the inside of Link's House in [[wikipedia:The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past|The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past]].
* Having a trapdoor under the carpet is a reference to the fact that Isaac escapes from his [[Mom|mother]] by finding one under a carpet in his bedroom. Likewise, the barred door might also allude to the intro, where his mother locks him inside his room.
* Despite being so similar, Clean and Dirty Bedrooms have different room ids (18 and 19 respectively).
* {{dlc|r}} Bedrooms are the only special rooms that are not automatically identified on the map before entering them, since shops, libraries, vaults, and dice rooms were all given distinctive doors in Repentance, but clean and dirty bedrooms still have the same doors.

